#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:300
msgid "️Public email"
msgstr "️Offentlig e-postadress"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:311
#, python-format
msgid ""
"One of your verified emails can be displayed on your <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">public profile</a> to logged-in users."
msgstr ""
"En av dina verifierade e-postadresser kan visas för inloggade användare på "
"din <a href=\"%(href)s\">offentliga profil</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:316
msgid "Update account"
msgstr "Uppdatera konto"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:324
#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:244
msgid "Account emails"
msgstr "Kontots e-postadresser"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:326
msgid ""
"You can associate several emails with your account. You can use any <span "
"class=\"badge badge--success\"><i class=\"fa fa-check\" aria-"
"hidden=\"true\"></i> Verified</span> email to recover your account, but only"
" your <span class=\"badge\">Primary</span> email will receive notifications."
msgstr ""
"Du kan koppla flera e-postadresser till ditt konto. Du kan använda vilken "
"<span class=\"badge badge--success\"><i class=\"fa fa-check\" aria-"
"hidden=\"true\"></i> Verifierad</span> e-postadress som helst för att "
"återställa ditt konto, men bara din <span class=\"badge\">Primär</span> "
"e-postadress får aviseringar."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:335
#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:255
msgid "Emails associated with your account"
msgstr "E-postadresser kopplade till ditt konto"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:400
msgid "Your current password"
msgstr "Ditt nuvarande lösenord"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:459
msgid "Update password"
msgstr "Uppdatera lösenord"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:470
msgid "Account associations"
msgstr "Kontokopplingar"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:472
msgid ""
"Link your PyPI account with external services. Connected accounts may be "
"used for account recovery or accessing service-specific features."
msgstr ""
"Koppla ditt PyPI-konto till externa tjänster. Anslutna konton kan användas "
"för att återställa kontot eller använda tjänstespecifika funktioner."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:476
msgid "Services linked to your account"
msgstr "Tjänster som är kopplade till ditt konto"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:519
#, python-format
msgid "Remove %(service)s association"
msgstr "Ta bort kopplingen till %(service)s"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:545
#, python-format
msgid "Remove %(service)s association?"
msgstr "Ta bort kopplingen till %(service)s?"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:548
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Removing this association will disconnect your %(service)s account "
"<strong>%(username)s</strong> from PyPI."
msgstr ""
"Om du tar bort den här kopplingen kopplas ditt %(service)s-konto "
"<strong>%(username)s</strong> bort från PyPI."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:553
#, python-format
msgid "You can reconnect your %(service)s account at any time."
msgstr "Du kan återansluta ditt %(service)s-konto när som helst."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:574
msgid "You have not connected any external accounts yet."
msgstr "Du har inte anslutit några externa konton ännu."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:585
msgid "Connect external accounts"
msgstr "Anslut externa konton"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:587
msgid ""
"Link your external accounts to your PyPI account. You'll be redirected to "
"authorize the connection."
msgstr ""
"Koppla dina externa konton till ditt PyPI-konto. Du skickas vidare för att "
"godkänna anslutningen."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:594
msgid "Connect GitHub"
msgstr "Anslut GitHub"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:601
msgid "Connect GitLab"
msgstr "Anslut GitLab"
